              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 22:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aitodol naedaunia EJAKAIT aisiyeŋun ikusiinacan, kwape yes, ido kedaut kesi da airum akwap naeinakini EJAKAIT Ekusideke, kosodete iboŋorete kirumata akwap naka airumetekus, nakiinakini Musa ekejaanakinan loka EJAKAIT kokekwa loka Yorodan mape elomununia akoloŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
